### Necessário para pegar o token
### Post
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

###

### sem token
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPacientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### token inválido
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPacientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

###

### dados inválidos
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPaciente HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "",
    "cpf": "123",
    "telefone": "abc",
    "data_nascimento": "31-02-2026"
}

###

### teste de inserção de paciente
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPaciente HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Carlos Matias",
    "cpf": "45678901234",
    "telefone": "(17) 97777-0003",
    "data_nascimento": "1990-04-18"
}

###

### teste de buscar todos os pacientes
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPacientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### teste de buscar paciente por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPacienteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### ID inexistente
GET http://localhost:40000/getPacienteByID/999999 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### teste de atualização de paciente
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePaciente/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Ana Lima Atualizada",
    "cpf": "12345678901",
    "telefone": "(17) 99999-0001",
    "data_nascimento": "1988-03-12"
}

###

### teste de exclusão lógica
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePaciente/3 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### registro já removido ou inexistente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePaciente/999999 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
